// Project `platform-infrastructure`: the deployment process is intentionally empty (ADR-IR34 §7.0).
// All work runs as config-as-code runbooks in runbooks/: env-plan, env-apply, env-destroy (infra-nonprod only),
// apps-plan, apps-apply, rotate-db-passwords, env-wake and env-sleep.
// Top-level entries of this file would be `step` blocks; there are none, so no release can deploy anything.
